---
---
<!-- ── RANCHHAND ── -->
<section class="rh-section" id="ranchhand">
  <div class="rh-inner">
    <div class="rh-grid">

      <!-- Left: pitch + pricing -->
      <div>
        <div class="rh-product-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          <span>Managed Gateway Appliance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rh-product-name"><em>Ranch</em>Hand™</div>
        <div class="rh-tagline">Keep your ISP. Upgrade your network.</div>
        <p class="rh-desc">RanchHand is a managed HowdyNET Gateway appliance that plugs in between your existing ISP modem and your network. We ship it preconfigured, install it remotely, and manage it 24/7 — whether you're in our service area or not.</p>

        <div class="rh-anywhere">
          <div class="rh-anywhere-title">📍 Works anywhere. Any ISP. Any location.</div>
          <div class="rh-anywhere-body">Not in our service area yet? RanchHand works with Comcast, AT&T, Spectrum, or any other ISP you're stuck with. One managed appliance, zero ISP changes required. Includes secure VPN so you're on your own network from anywhere — even camping under the stars. When HowdyNET expands to your area, upgrading is seamless.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing options -->
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,106,26,0.25);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;position:relative;">
            <div style="position:absolute;top:-10px;left:18px;background:#E86A1A;color:#fff;font-size:0.55rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;">Most Flexible</div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
              <span style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;color:#E86A1A;">$79</span>
              <span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">/month</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:4px 0;">Month-to-month + $199 hardware deposit</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);line-height:1.6;">Cancel anytime — deposit fully refunded within 90 days if hardware is returned in working condition. No surprises, no traps.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(232,106,26,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(232,106,26,0.4);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;position:relative;">
            <div style="position:absolute;top:-10px;left:18px;background:rgba(139,34,0,0.9);color:#F5956A;font-size:0.55rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;">Best Value</div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
              <span style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;color:#E86A1A;">$79</span>
              <span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">/month</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:4px 0;">12-month commitment · hardware included</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);line-height:1.6;">Hardware ships preconfigured at no extra cost. Same $79/mo — the commitment covers our ROI on the appliance. Best deal, honest math.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div style="font-size:0.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);margin-bottom:10px;">Included in both plans</div>
          <ul class="rh-pricing-includes">
            <li>HowdyNET Gateway appliance — preconfigured, plug &amp; play</li>
            <li>Remote setup, config &amp; ongoing management</li>
            <li>24/7 performance monitoring &amp; alerts</li>
            <li>Bufferbloat remediation &amp; smart QoS tuning</li>
            <li>DNS-level ad blocking &amp; content filtering</li>
            <li>Network fingerprinting &amp; behavioral traffic enforcement</li>
            <li>Secure VPN — your ranch, wherever you roam</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="#contact" class="rh-btn">Get RanchHand&#8482; &#x2192;</a>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:0.68rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.22);">No markup on hardware &middot; ships preconfigured &middot; plug in, you&#39;re managed</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: feature cards -->
      <div class="rh-features">
        <div class="rh-feature">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-perf">Performance</span>
            <h3>Bufferbloat Remediation</h3>
            <p>We tune your gateway's QoS settings to eliminate bufferbloat — the #1 cause of choppy video calls and laggy apps, even on fast connections. Most routers ship with this off. We turn it on and dial it in.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-perf">Performance</span>
            <h3>Smart Traffic Shaping</h3>
            <p>Prioritize your VoIP calls, video conferencing, and critical business apps automatically. POS systems and payment terminals always get bandwidth priority. Backups and updates run in the background, not during business hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-filter">Filtering</span>
            <h3>DNS-Level Ad Blocking</h3>
            <p>Block ads, trackers, and malicious domains at the network level — before they reach any device. Faster page loads, less bandwidth waste, and no more ads on the TV in your lobby.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-filter">Filtering</span>
            <h3>Content Filtering by Category</h3>
            <p>Block categories of content across your entire network — adult content, gambling, social media during work hours, or anything else. Guest networks can have different rules than staff networks. You set the policy, we enforce it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 20V10M12 20V4M6 20v-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-perf">Performance</span>
            <h3>24/7 Monitoring &amp; Alerts</h3>
            <p>We watch your connection around the clock. If your ISP goes down, latency spikes, or something unusual happens on your network, we know before you do — and we act on it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature" style="border-color:rgba(232,106,26,0.25);background:rgba(232,106,26,0.05);">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(232,106,26,0.15);">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--flame)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-perf" style="background:rgba(232,106,26,0.2);color:var(--flame);">Signature Feature</span>
            <h3>Network Fingerprinting</h3>
            <p>We learn what your network looks like when everything is healthy — your devices, your traffic patterns, your normal. Then we enforce it. Unrecognized traffic gets flagged and blocked before it becomes a problem. Most businesses don't know what's on their own network. We do.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rh-feature" style="border-color:rgba(26,159,224,0.2);background:rgba(26,159,224,0.04);">
          <div class="rh-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(26,159,224,0.12);">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
              <path d="M2 12h20"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="rh-feature-tag tag-filter" style="background:rgba(26,159,224,0.12);color:var(--sky);">Remote Access</span>
            <h3>Your ranch, wherever you roam. 🤠</h3>
            <p>RanchHand includes a secure VPN tunnel back to your business network — from anywhere in the world. Camping under the Texas stars, traveling for work, or working from home — your phone and laptop appear on your own network, behind your own protections, with your own rules enforced. No sketchy third-party VPN. Your network. Your hat. Anywhere.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
